0..76 Comment "// A reflected truth-table check shows that three pigeons never sit one to a"
77..98 Comment "// hole in two holes."
99..101 Comment "//"
102..183 Comment "// Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire check the pigeonhole principle by a reflected"
184..259 Comment "// decision procedure. A run of the procedure stands where a proof by cases"
260..269 Comment "// would."
270..272 Comment "//"
273..348 Comment "// The formula makes each pigeon\'s place in each hole a variable. The check"
349..427 Comment "// sets each variable both ways and evaluates the formula under all sixty-four"
428..443 Comment "// assignments."
444..446 Comment "//"
447..525 Comment "// - see: Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire, _Full Reduction at Full Throttle_,"
526..601 Comment "//   CPP 2011, § 4, BDD, which decides by binary decision diagrams instead"
602..639 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
641..693 Comment "// The free naturals and the numerals two and three."
694..700 Keyword "import"
701..702 StringLit "\""
702..725 StringLit "../data/data-base.gandr"
725..726 StringLit "\""
726..727 Other ";"
